 "summary": "A single planar Schottky barrier rectifier rated 20 V reverse and 2 A forward, with a guard ring built in to withstand stress. Forward drop is 450 mV typical at 2 A and 200 mV at 10 mA. Two flat-lead surface-mount packages are offered: PMEG2020EH in SOD123F and PMEG2020EJ in SOD323F (SC-90). PMEG2020EH,115 is the SOD123F part on a 3000-piece reel.",
